# A refused cutover leaves the target policy its attempt installed before the
# fenced swap was refused.
MODULE: SupersededLeavesNothingKeepsInstalledPolicy
TARGET: SupersededLeavesNothing
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a swap refused as superseded keeps the policy installed before it
PERTURBS: Supersede

--- FIND
    /\ policy' = IF cstep = 1 THEN prevPol ELSE policy
--- REPLACE
    /\ policy' = policy
--- END